WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.933
Cat walked around town.

2
00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:22.648
It was very busy.

3
00:00:22.649 --> 00:00:27.934
Cat saw cars.

4
00:00:27.935 --> 00:00:33.748
She saw bikes.

5
00:00:33.749 --> 00:00:40.114
She saw lots of shops.

6
00:00:40.115 --> 00:00:49.342
And she saw lots of people.

7
00:00:49.343 --> 00:00:52.273
Then Cat smelled something.

8
00:00:52.274 --> 00:01:00.061
"Mmm! Food!" said Cat.

9
00:01:00.062 --> 00:01:01.835
"Pig would like it here!"

10
00:01:01.836 --> 00:01:04.499
Cat walked some more.

11
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.116
A big dog barked at her.

12
00:01:07.117 --> 00:01:28.411
Cat ran away!

13
00:01:28.412 --> 00:01:33.902
Cat fed some birds.

14
00:01:33.903 --> 00:01:39.521
She had another snack.

15
00:01:39.522 --> 00:01:43.254
Soon Cat was tired.

16
00:01:43.255 --> 00:01:52.708
She walked back to the lot.

17
00:01:52.709 --> 00:01:59.833
"I will get in Farmer's truck," said Cat.

18
00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:05.075
"We will go home soon."

19
00:02:05.076 --> 00:02:12.245
But Cat did not see Farmer.

20
00:02:12.246 --> 00:02:15.360
She did not see Farmer's truck.

21
00:02:15.361 --> 00:02:18.438
"Oh no," said Cat.

22
00:02:18.439 --> 00:02:20.675
"Farmer is gone!

23
00:02:20.676 --> 00:02:24.822
I am all alone!"

